{
  "about": [
    "Substitution penalties for check.mismatch, from 0 (same sound) to 1 (unrelated).",
    "Any substitution not covered here costs 1, as do insertion and deletion.",
    "'pairs' are symmetric: [a, b, penalty]. A pair may name whole phonemes ('j', 'i̯').",
    "'modifiers' price a diacritic that one phoneme has and the other lacks. Two phonemes",
    "are compared as base letter + diacritics: the base pair's penalty (0 when the bases",
    "match) plus each unmatched diacritic, capped at 1. So 'eː' vs 'ɛ' = 0.25 + 0.2.",
    "Scale: 0.1-0.2 barely audible / allophonic; 0.25-0.35 one feature apart",
    "(height step, voicing, aspiration); 0.4-0.5 clearly different but often confused",
    "(place of a fricative, stop vs fricative); 0.6-0.7 related but distinct."
  ],
